{
  "id": "collector-s-tins",
  "name": "Collector's Tins",
  "category": "product_promotion",
  "description": {
    "text": "Collector's Tins were the English card game's seasonal tins from 2007 to 2010, sold in spring and fall waves, with a holiday pair in 2008. Each tin held four booster packs and a holofoil card found in no pack. The spring 2007 tins held cosmos holofoil copies of POP Series ex cards outside North America and of the Diamond & Pearl starter Pokémon in North America. From 2008 each tin's card was a holofoil Black Star promo, many with art made for the English tins: LV.X cards through 2009, the Johto starters' final forms as Pokémon Prime in spring 2010, and the shiny legendary beasts in fall 2010, each paired with a Cracked Ice copy of its Secret Wonders card.",
